JUST RICH — ASSISTANCE

To contact support, report a bug or propose an improvement:

Justracedstudio@gmail.com

In your message, indicate if possible:

- the model of your iPhone;

- the iOS version and the application version;

- the steps that make it possible to reproduce the problem.

You can attach a screenshot by hiding the personal information you don't want to share. Do not send any passwords or banking information.

SETTINGS

The "..." button on the application allows you to change your first name, your address formula and your notification preferences.

NOTIFICATIONS

Reminders are optional and scheduled locally on your iPhone. Check their permission in iOS notification settings. Focus mode and the scheduled summary can change their presentation.

The application does not detect the first unlock of your iPhone: the morning reminder follows the chosen time slot.

STORIES OF THE DAY

Each opening from the background or each new launch adds a sentence. Tap left or right, or use the arrows, to reread the sentences of the day. This navigation does not create a new sentence.

The stories are renewed on the new local day. If the application remains open during the change of day, a new opening allows the first sentence of the day to be displayed.

